# merge：当前分支是被合并分支祖先，fast-forward
> init
<<<

# master 提交基线后建 other
+ base.txt mbase.txt
> add base.txt
<<<
> commit "base"
<<<
> branch other
<<<

# 切到 other 追加提交（新增一个文件）
> checkout other
<<<
+ added.txt monlygiven.txt
> add added.txt
<<<
> commit "other work"
<<<

# 回到落后的 master，合并 other 应快进
> checkout master
<<<
> merge other
Current branch fast-forwarded.
<<<

# 工作目录换成 other 快照：基线文件与新增文件都在
= base.txt mbase.txt
= added.txt monlygiven.txt

# 仍在 master 分支上（HEAD 未指向 other），快进后工作区干净
> status
=== Branches ===
*master
other

=== Staged Files ===

=== Removed Files ===

=== Modifications Not Staged For Commit ===

=== Untracked Files ===

<<<
